    {
     "k": "text",
     "id": "id3",
     "cls": "style_SkipStroke_2 shape-with-text",
     "style": "height: 238px; left: 27px; position: absolute; top: 22px; width: 266px; z-index: 1; ",
     "contentCls": "text-content Normal_External_266_238",
     "contentStyle": "padding: 0px; ",
     "nodes": [
      {
       "tag": "#text",
       "v": "\n              "
      },
      {
       "tag": "div",
       "attrs": {
        "class": "Normal"
       },
       "c": [
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "style": "padding-top: 0pt; ",
          "class": "Free_Form"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "span",
           "attrs": {
            "style": "line-height: 14px; ",
            "class": "style_1"
           },
           "c": [
            {
             "tag": "#text",
             "v": "For nearly a month, I was on the expedition ship "
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "tag": "span",
           "attrs": {
            "class": "style_2"
           },
           "c": [
            {
             "tag": "#text",
             "v": "Ushuaia"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "tag": "#text",
           "v": " with about 80 fellow passengers. We departed from Ushuaia, Argentina and visited the Falkland Islands, South Georgia Island and the Antarctic Peninsula. All of these places are magical destinations — amazing scenery and wildlife. I feel very privileged to have had the opportunity to visit these locations."
          },
          {
           "tag": "br"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "class": "paragraph_style"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "br"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "class": "paragraph_style"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "span",
           "attrs": {
            "class": "style_3"
           },
           "c": [
            {
             "tag": "#text",
             "v": "The tour was arranged by "
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "tag": "a",
           "attrs": {
            "title": "http://www.photosafaris.com",
            "href": "http://www.photosafaris.com"
           },
           "c": [
            {
             "tag": "#text",
             "v": "Joseph Van Os Photo Safaris"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "tag": "span",
           "attrs": {
            "class": "style_3"
           },
           "c": [
            {
             "tag": "#text",
             "v": ". Joe, along with his staff and the ship’s crew, did a great job keeping us safe, giving us great photographic opportunities, and educating us along the way."
            },
            {
             "tag": "br"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "class": "paragraph_style"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "span",
           "attrs": {
            "class": "style_3"
           },
           "c": [
            {
             "tag": "br"
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "style": "padding-bottom: 0pt; ",
          "class": "paragraph_style"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "span",
           "attrs": {
            "class": "style_3"
           },
           "c": [
            {
             "tag": "#text",
             "v": "Click on the photos below to view galleries from each of the locations."
            }
           ]
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n              "
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "tag": "#text",
       "v": "\n            "
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "k": "text",
     "id": "id4",
     "cls": "style_SkipStroke_1 shape-with-text",
     "style": "height: 330px; left: 181px; position: absolute; top: 290px; width: 344px; z-index: 1; ",
     "contentCls": "text-content graphic_textbox_layout_style_default_External_344_330",
     "contentStyle": "padding: 0px; ",
     "nodes": [
      {
       "tag": "#text",
       "v": "\n              "
      },
      {
       "tag": "div",
       "attrs": {
        "class": "graphic_textbox_layout_style_default"
       },
       "c": [
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "style": "padding-top: 0pt; ",
          "class": "paragraph_style"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "a",
           "attrs": {
            "title": "Falkland_Islands.html",
            "href": "/falkland-islands"
           },
           "c": [
            {
             "tag": "#text",
             "v": "Falkland Islands"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "tag": "#text",
           "v": " — I expected that this would be a boring stop on the way to South Georgia, but I was pleasantly surprised to see that the Falklands (referred to as the Malvinas by Argentinians) offered some amazing scenery and wildlife of its own."
          },
          {
           "tag": "br"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "class": "paragraph_style"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "br"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "class": "paragraph_style"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "br"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "class": "paragraph_style"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "br"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "class": "paragraph_style"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "a",
           "attrs": {
            "title": "South_Georgia.html",
            "href": "/south-georgia"
           },
           "c": [
            {
             "tag": "#text",
             "v": "South Georgia Island"
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "tag": "#text",
           "v": " — This was the part of the trip that I was most eagerly anticipating, and I was not disappointed. In many respects, this was the most wild place we visited. It was definitely the most rich in wildlife."
          },
          {
           "tag": "br"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "class": "paragraph_style"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "br"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "tag": "#text",
         "v": "\n                "
        },
        {
         "tag": "p",
         "attrs": {
          "class": "paragraph_style"
         },
         "c": [
          {
           "tag": "br"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
